    · exact h707 p hpe
    · exact h731 p hpe
    · exact h732 p hpe
    · exact h762 p hpe
    · exact h763 p hpe
    · exact h846 p hpe
  refine eqAll_sound t5 _ _ (assoc bls) hbl adv 200 advOk c h1 ?_
  rw [adv_len]; exact h2

